{
  "about": "Shared by web/src/lib/requirements.test.ts and mobile/src/test/requirements.test.ts. presentRequirements(list) takes [{slug, name, mandatory, importance}] and returns {main, also}: identical names (case and spaces ignored) collapse to one keeping the strongest flag and the highest importance; a name with no lowercase letter is sentence-cased; generic entries (Employability skills, OJT, on-the-job training) move to 'also'. Order within each group: mandatory first, then importance, then the order given.",
